### The captcha OCR tool
# Captcha/ is 86MB of vendored ddddocr and its ONNX models, and it carries its own .git.
# Committing it as it stands adds a gitlink rather than the files, so a clone would get an
# empty folder and every AUTO captcha row would fall back to asking a human. UMPay tracks
# nothing under Captcha either. Copy the folder across from that project when setting this
# one up; config.properties points at it with captcha.ocr.script.
Captcha/
